2.7 Percentage share of total population by Local Government Area
According to the provisional results of the census, all LGAs’ percentage share of the total
population in 2013 when compared to 2003 declined except for Brikama LGA. In Brikama
whereas the LGA accounted for 28.6 per cent of the total population in 2003 their percentage
share of the population increased to 37.2 per cent. As indicated earlier the rapid increase in
the population of Brikama can be explained by the migration of both Gambians and non-
Gambians into the LGA over the past decade.
